WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:04.587
I see Xuan Kingdom's flag I see Xuan Kingdom's flag.

00:05.640 --> 00:11.440
I see Xuan Kingdom's military flag the royal army is going north I see Xuan Kingdom's military flag the royal army is going north.

00:11.520 --> 00:14.200
Stop wailing can you even read?

00:14.360 --> 00:19.560
I only know my father drew it for me before he died that really is Xuan Kingdom's military flag.

00:19.640 --> 00:21.307
I see so many soldiers.

00:22.320 --> 00:27.200
If you don't believe me, come and see really come on, come on hurry up.

00:33.400 --> 00:37.533
Your Highness that little thief we chased earlier has brought a group of people over.

00:48.400 --> 00:50.733
It really is Xuan Kingdom's military flag.

00:53.360 --> 00:54.760
It's true.

00:56.480 --> 00:59.080
We respectfully welcome the royal army going north.

01:05.360 --> 01:07.600
Sheathe your swords dismount.

01:10.040 --> 01:11.440
All rise.

01:16.400 --> 01:21.720
Hearing the royal army is going north passing through our village we gathered some grain.

01:22.920 --> 01:24.520
Everyone, share it.

01:33.680 --> 01:39.253
Sir the village has been stripped bare by the Wutu.

01:39.680 --> 01:42.120
This please don't look down on it.

